          "kicker": "Describe",
          "text": "Masaccio painted this fresco in Florence around **1425**. Follow the lines of the **ceiling**: where do they meet?"
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Construction",
          "text": "They meet near the **eye height** of a person standing in the church: the flat wall opens into a **chapel** that is not there."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Critical",
          "text": "The space is built for one standing viewer. ==Who== is that ideal viewer, and where must everyone else stand?"
        }
